[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16502.709, "timestamp": "04:35:02", "text": "无论如何。至少这一次是我的最后一次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16505.029, "timestamp": "04:35:05", "text": "天。今天我一定会确保这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16507.59, "timestamp": "04:35:07", "text": "这是正确的，请确保它是正确的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16511.75, "timestamp": "04:35:11", "text": "正确的部分。你好。是的，我需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16514.789, "timestamp": "04:35:14", "text": "重新熟悉周围环境。所以一旦我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16518.709, "timestamp": "04:35:18", "text": "仿佛在未来的某个时候，我又回到了这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16523.47, "timestamp": "04:35:23", "text": "我能认清方向，对吧？是的。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16526.51, "timestamp": "04:35:26", "text": "所以那将是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16529.51, "timestamp": "04:35:29", "text": "好的。说了很多话之后，我的嗓子……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16532.869, "timestamp": "04:35:32", "text": "完全干涸了。我应该带水的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16535.269, "timestamp": "04:35:35", "text": "与我一起。但同时，这也让人很麻烦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16537.99, "timestamp": "04:35:37", "text": "手里拿着水瓶。但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16540.709, "timestamp": "04:35:40", "text": "我手里就拿着手机。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16559.67, "timestamp": "04:35:59", "text": "[音乐]"}]